  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paris Agreement Implementation Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support to Least Developed Countries (LDC) Group of Negotiators and the Alliance of Small Island States (AOSIS) Group of Negotiators to participation and capacity building for international environmental negotations and implementation. The International Centre for Climate Change and Development will be enabled to provide parts of the support under the agreement. UNDP and its Climate Promise branch facilitates the support.</narrative>
  </description>
